/span><span class="ff2 fc0">确定一个下降方向<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Descent<span class="_ _0"> </span>Direction)<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffd">Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xa0 h15 ya15 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x75 h3 ya14 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">。</div><div class="t m0 xbd h3 ya16 ff3 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _56"> </span><span class="ff2 fc0">选择一个步长<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Step<span class="_ _0"> </span>Size)<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝛼</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x67 h15 ya17 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x6e h3 ya16 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">&gt;<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">0<span class="ff2">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xbd h3 ya18 ff3 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="_ _56"> </span><span class="ff2 fc0">更新：<span class="ff8">𝑥</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xbc h15 ya19 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _1"></span></span>+<span class="ffb">1<span class="_ _1"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x9c h12 ya18 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥</span></div><div class="t m0 x134 h15 ya19 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x9d h11 ya18 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">+<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝛼</span></div><div class="t m0 x9e h15 ya19 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x3f h12 ya18 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥</span></div><div class="t m0 xe2 h15 ya19 ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 xa2 h3 ya18 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">。</div><div class="t m0 xbd h3 ya1a ff3 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="_ _2c"> </span><span class="ff2 fc0">直至<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Until)</span>：满足停止条件（例如<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">∇<span class="_ _19"></span><span class="ff8">𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑥</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x105 h15 ya1b ffa fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffc">𝑘<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</div><div class="t m0 x48 h3 ya1a ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff2">足够小）<span class="_ _29"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ya1c ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">核心要素：<span class="ff4">该框架是后续所有算法的“主算法”<span class="_ _29"></span>。<span class="_ _3"></span>梯度下降法（章节<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff3 fc4">4.3</span>）和牛顿法（章节<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff3 fc4">4.4</span>）均为该框</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ya1d ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">架的特定实现。</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 ya1e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">方向<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffd">Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span></span></span>的选择<span class="ff4">：决定了算法的类型（例如：梯度法<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">vs<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>牛顿法）<span class="_ _29"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 ya1f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">步长<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝛼<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>的选择<span class="ff4">：决定了算法的收敛速度和稳定性（例如：精确线搜索<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff3">vs<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>固定步长）<span class="_ _29"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 ya20 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">4.2.2<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>下降方向<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Descent<span