/span><span class="ffa">)</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xa5 h14 ya24 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x5b h6 ya23 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff4">。为保证<span class="_ _17"> </span></span>𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _19"> </span></span>𝛼<span class="_ _1"></span></span>Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>&lt;<span class="_ _2c"> </span>𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝑥<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff4">，必须满</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ya25 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">足<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">∇<span class="_ _19"></span><span class="ff8">𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _15"></span></span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11b h14 ya26 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 xe9 h6 ya25 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _20"> </span>&lt;<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">0<span class="ff4">。<span class="ff1">几何意义：</span>下降方向<span class="_ _c"> </span></span></span></span>Δ<span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff4">必须与梯度方向<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffa">∇<span class="_ _10"></span></span></span>𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _15"></span></span>𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff4">呈<span class="ff1">钝角<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Obtuse<span class="_ _0"> </span>Angle)</span></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 ya27 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">4.2.3<span class="_ _0"> </sp